{"d":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>Roto blueLine (R45, R65)</strong></span> - vienkameras siltumu izolējo&scaron;a stikla pakete, ārējais stikls rūdīts, pildīta ar argonu. Siltumvadāmības koeficients Ug=1,1 W/m2K.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>Roto blueLine Plus (R48A, R68A)</strong></span> - Siltumnoturīga vienkameru stikla pakete: ārējais stikls rūdīts ar pa&scaron;attīro&scaron;o pārklājumu Aquaclear, iek&scaron;pusē 6mm dro&scaron;s stikls tripleks, aizsardzība pret trok&scaron;ņiem Ug=1,1 W/m2K.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>Roto blueLine NE (R69E)</strong></span><b style=\"color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-family: Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span lang=\"DE\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"> - </font></span></b>divkameru zemas emisijas stiklapakete, 3 rūdīti stikli, ārējais ar Aquaclear pārklājumu (pa&scaron;attīro&scaron;a funkcija), pildīts ar kriptonu. Siltumvadāmības koefi cients&nbsp;Ug&nbsp;= 0,5 W/m&sup2;K</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>WD</strong></span> - Jumta logi ar siltumizolācijas WD bloku nodro&scaron;ina loga siltumizolācijas rādītājus par vairāk kā 15%.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Logu un pieslēgumu izmērus un cenas skatieties katra modeļa saturā.</strong></p><br><br>","t":{"Designo R4 – logi ar centrālo vērtnes asi":"<p><img width=\"78\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/r4_fot.png\" /><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 102, 0);\"><strong>Designo R4</strong></span><img width=\"80\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"80\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/R4.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><br />\r\n<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">Pateicoties jaunajam dizainam un ārējo uzliku krāsai ( pelēks metāliks R703), logs labāk sader ar jumtu. Designo R4 izskatās identiski, tāpat kā cita tipa logs Designo R7 - ar paceltu vērtnes asi. Tāpēc &scaron;os logus viegli kombinēt savā starpā, grūti pieejamās vietās der R4 logs, bet logs R7 der ikdienas lieto&scaron;anas vietās.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-family: Verdana, Tahoma, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); margin: 0cm 0cm 10pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>Loga īpa&scaron;ības:</strong></font></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">logs atrodas iepakojumā gatavs uzstādī&scaron;anai, pielikti montāžas stiprinājumi.<br />\r\n    </span></span></font></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">rūpnieciski uzstādīts siltumizolācijas bloks ( versijā WD) un tvaika izolācijas plēve (versijā WD)<br />\r\n    </span></span></font></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">jauns dizains un ārējo uzliku krāsa (pelēks metāliks R703)<br />\r\n    </span></span></font></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">logam ir ventilācijas vārsts (izņemot logus ar WD)<br />\r\n    </span></span></font></span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: black; font-size: 9pt;\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"line-height: 14px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">iespējams regulēt vērtni pēc loga uzstādī&scaron;anas</span></span></font></span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Designo R4</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">standartā ir bez siltumizolācijas bloka WD. Neskatoties uz to mēs Jums iesakām pasūtīt versiju WD. Siltumizolācijas bloks WD nodro&scaron;inās augstuma robežu, kura viegli var rasties loga un jumta savienojuma vietā un samazinās siltuma zudumus visai konstrukcijai par 15%.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Logus Designo R4 </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 14px; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); display: inline !important; float: none;\">iespējams aprīkot ar elektromotoru un tālvadības pulti (versijās R4/R6 Roto Tronic EF) vai ar sienas slēdzi ( versijā R4/R6 Roto Tronic E). Visiem Roto Tronic logiem komplektā nāk lietus sensors, kur&scaron; logu aiztaisa lietus vai snig&scaron;anas gadījumā.</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"><em>Izmēru variācijas skat. preces saturā!</em></span></p>","Designo R7 – logi ar piepaceltu vērtnes asi":"<p><span lang=\"ET\" style=\"color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><img width=\"110\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/r7_logs.png\" alt=\"\" />Vienīgais jumta logs ar vairāk kā par &frac34; tā garuma paceltu vērtnes pagrieziena asi. &Scaron;is tehniskais risinājums nodro&scaron;ina, ka pagrieziena laikā vērtne nepaliek telpas iek&scaron;pusē.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(49, 49, 49); font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Atverot logu, varat skatīties pa to, stāvot visā augumā, nebaidoties sasist galvu. Modeļa mehānismā izmantotie gāzes amortizatori ļauj viegli atvērt un apkalpot &scaron;ī modeļa logus.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(18, 18, 18); font-size: 10pt;\"><img width=\"80\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"80\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/r7_ico.jpg\" alt=\"\" />Priek&scaron;rocības:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: gray;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">unikāls Roto risinājums ir vērtnes<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18);\">pagrieziena ass &frac34; loga augstumā<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n    </span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: gray;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">dro&scaron;a un ērta loga apkalpo&scaron;ana,<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18);\">stāvot pilnā augumā<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n    </span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: gray;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">efektīva mansarda ventilācija un<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18);\">papildus apgaismojums<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n    </span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: gray;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">automātiska vērtnes bloķē&scaron;ana<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18);\">mazgā&scaron;anas pozīcijā<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n    </span></li>\r\n    <li><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: gray;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span style=\"color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\">rūpnīcā uzstādīts siltumizolācijas<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 15px; orphans: 2; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; color: rgb(18, 18, 18);\">bloks WD (kā opcija)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\"><em>Izmēru variācijas skat. preces saturā!</em></span></p>","Designo R8 – logs ar divām vērtnes pagrieziena asīm":"<p><strong><img width=\"110\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"103\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/R8_bilde.JPG\" alt=\"\" /></strong><strong>Designo R8</strong> logam ir divkār&scaron;a atvēr&scaron;anās sistēma, izmantojot vienu daudzfunkcionālu rokturi.Atgāžamajā pozīcijā logam ir dro&scaron;a un ērta piekļuve. Atvēr&scaron;anas pozīcija &frac34; loga augstumā - tā ir efektīva vēdinā&scaron;anas funkcija un iespēja ērti piekļūt atvērtam logam bez pieliek&scaron;anās. Mazgā&scaron;anas pozīcijā tiek nodro&scaron;ināta automātiska loga nobloķē&scaron;ana. Logi izceļas ar mūsdienīgu dizainu, zemāku montāžas augstumu, jaunu uzliku krāsu (pelēks antracīts, metāliks R703), ergonomisks daudzfunkcionāls rokturis un siltumizolācijas WD bloks standarta risinājumā. Pateicoties zemākam loga uzstādī&scaron;anas izvietojumam virs <img width=\"80\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"80\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/R8_ico.jpg\" />jumta, tiek iegūta optimāla jumta loga integrācija jumtā.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">WD siltinājuma bloks standarta komplektācijā</span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; color: gray; font-size: 10pt;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Zemāks loga uzstādī&scaron;anas izvietojums jumtā</span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Wingdings; color: gray; font-size: 10pt;\"><span><span style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: &#39;Times New Roman&#39;;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span></span></span></span><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Ārējo uzliku jauna krāsa &ndash; antracītpelēks metāliks</span></li>\r\n    <li><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">Logs noslēdzas 4 punktos</span></li>\r\n</ul>","Designo R4/R6 RotoTronic - logi ar elektromotoru un tālvadības pulti":"<p><a href=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/tronic.png\"><img width=\"78\" hspace=\"5\" height=\"110\" border=\"0\" align=\"left\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/tronic.png\" alt=\"\" /></a><img width=\"98\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"\" src=\"/userfiles/Image/logi/ROTO/RTronic.JPG\" />Designo R4/R6 RotoTronic logi<strong> aprīkoti ar elektromotoru un tālvadības pulti</strong> (versijās R4/R6 Roto Tronic EF) vai ar sienas slēdzi ( versijā R4/R6 Roto Tronic E). Visiem Roto Tronic logiem komplektā nāk lietus sensors, kur&scaron; logu aiztaisa lietus vai snig&scaron;anas gadījumā.</p>"}}